   "text": "**P2035_T1_T3_V10_Unobstructed** · result\n\nTheorems 1-3 (Unobstructed 10D Moduli Variety V_10 & Closed-Form Rational Curves): dim ker(J) = 151 = 141 + 10 (N_10 = B4 + Q*v32 + B55, 10 = 4+1+5), Kuranishi quadratic obstruction Sym^2(N_10) -> coker(J) vanishes identically (max_sv = 2.48e-14), and both B4 (s(tau)=-tau/(tau-1)^2, u(tau)=-tau/(tau+1)^2) and v32 (V[0](tau)=tau/((1+tau)(2+tau)), U[0][4](tau)=-(2+2*tau+tau^2)/(2-tau^2), EXACT RATIONAL BRENT MATCH over Q: True) integrate to exact rational curves.",
