   "text": "✗ **H2035_L16_wt2_diagonal_absorption_and_c3_rot** · hypothesis\n\nInspection of the full_wt=2, orb_wt=2 state (0 off-diagonal errors, only 2 diagonal residual bits for 22 = 7x3 + 1), enabling cyclic representative rotations (u_m,v_m,w_m)->(v_m,w_m,u_m) coupling all factor pairs across orbits plus fixed-term u_0 optimization and 18/27-bit seam surgery around full_wt=2.\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-017=0] Anatomy of 17,497 wt=2 states proved that 7 C_3^fac orbits (rank 21) reproduce all 726 off-diagonal entries of T_<3,3,3> exactly (orb3_wt=0), leaving only the 3-element diagonal tensor D_3 = E_00^3 + E_11^3 + E_22^3 (mask 0x111, R7_wt=3); a single fixed term E_ii^3 cancels only 1 of 3 diagonal bits (wt=2), whereas choosing u_0 = I_3 = E_00+E_11+E_22 (0x111) cancels all 3 diagonal bits of D_3 at once at the cost of injecting 8 off-diagonal orbits in {E_00,E_11,E_22}^3.",
