   "id": "H2035_L17_hadamard_diagonal_locked_u0_als",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **H2035_L17_hadamard_diagonal_locked_u0_als** · hypothesis\n\nExact elimination of the fixed term u_0 via the Hadamard diagonal identity u_0 = 0x111 ^ XOR_{m=0..6} (u_m & v_m & w_m), satisfying all 9 diagonal equations identically (diag_wt == 0 at every step!) and reducing <3,3,3:22> to zeroing the 240 off-diagonal bits orb3_wt via 1-factor and 18-bit pairwise Gray-MITM from the Lille-23 warm start.\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-018=0] Hadamard diagonal lock u_0 = 0x111 ^ XOR_{m=0..6} (u_m & v_m & w_m) maintained diag_mask=0x0 identically and in thread T3 forced absorption of the diagonal bit E_11^3 via u_m & v_m & w_m = 0x010, reducing u_0 from 0x111 (3 bits, 8 side-effect orbits) to u_0 = 0x101 = E_00 + E_22 (2 bits, only 2 side-effect orbits) and lowering off-diagonal error to min_orb3_wt = 3 (full_wt = 9, diag_wt = 0).",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 220,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "H2035_L18_wt1_u0_hadamard_seeded_intra_inter_mitm",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **H2035_L18_wt1_u0_hadamard_seeded_intra_inter_mitm** · hypothesis\n\nEnforcing weight wt(u_0) <= 1 (XOR(u_m & v_m & w_m) in {0x110, 0x101, 0x011, 0x111}, so u_0^3 injects 0 off-diagonal orbits) by seeding diagonal bits E_11 (16) and E_22 (256) into (u_m, v_m, w_m) combined with 18-bit intra-orbit (u_m, v_m) and inter-orbit (u_m1, u_m2) Gray-MITM.\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-019=0] Seeding diagonal bits on the raw starting state (before reaching orb3_wt=0 from L-F4R3-017) inflates u0 to 0x11e (wt=5, +40 off-diagonal orbits, orb3_wt=111), causing 18-bit Gray-MITM to fall into a trivial monomial trap (orb3_wt=7 via orbit duplication O_0=O_2, O_1=O_4 and rank-1 degeneration O_3=(1,1,1), O_6=(16,16,16) since T_<3,3,3> itself has only 8 off-diagonal orbits and 3 diagonal terms).",
   "x": 2940,
   "y": 220,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "H2035_L19_orb3_wt0_fiber_gl3_conjugation_nondegen",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **H2035_L19_orb3_wt0_fiber_gl3_conjugation_nondegen** · hypothesis\n\nExploration of the non-degenerate orb3_wt=0 fiber (with guards against u_m=v_m=w_m, orbit duplication O_m1=O_m2, and unfolding-rank drop below 8) combined with 18-bit in-fiber MITM and testing all 511^3 rank-1 terms u_0 x v_0 x w_0 and 168 automorphisms of GL_3(F_2).\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-020=0] On the true Lille-23 + O_6(32,128,176) warm start with hard non-degeneracy guards (mode1_rank=9, no duplicates or u=v=w): (1) all 1,973 visited states of the orb3_wt=0 fiber invariantly preserve diag_wt=3 (diag_mask=0x111, bitmask=0x8); (2) under enforced wt(u0)=1 (u0=0x100, diag_mask=0x0), non-degenerate 18-bit Gray-MITM descends from orb3_wt=42 to orb3_wt=4 (full_729_wt=12, mode1_rk=9), and globally to non-degenerate orb3_wt=3 (full_729_wt=9, mode1_rk=9).",
   "x": 3360,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  }
